WEBVTT

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.090
We aren't getting that many hits...

00:00:12.090 --> 00:00:15.420
They just announced that we're forming a unit.

00:00:15.420 --> 00:00:19.680
No! This is exactly when
we should start feeling panicked.

00:00:19.680 --> 00:00:23.180
Is it because we don't have a CD out yet?

00:00:23.180 --> 00:00:26.520
The web radio show was pretty popular, though.

00:00:26.520 --> 00:00:31.380
Oh, but having numbers like this after
just a dozen or so episodes is pretty nice!

00:00:31.380 --> 00:00:32.860
What are you saying?

00:00:32.860 --> 00:00:35.320
Earphones has the great lchigo-sama!

00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:37.990
We'll get a million hits in no time!

00:00:37.990 --> 00:00:38.780
A million?!

00:00:38.780 --> 00:00:40.360
And the next week, we'll get twice that!

00:00:40.360 --> 00:00:41.640
Two million?!

00:00:41.990 --> 00:00:45.140
I wonder if that day will really come...

00:00:45.140 --> 00:00:47.830
Don't worry, we can do it!

00:00:47.830 --> 00:00:51.830
If we don't believe in ourselves,
we won't get any results!

00:00:55.710 --> 00:00:56.660
See you later.

00:00:57.090 --> 00:00:59.470
Thank you for seeing us off.

00:00:59.470 --> 00:01:01.310
See you at the next radio recording.

00:01:01.510 --> 00:01:03.960
It's your turn to write for the blog next, okay?

00:01:03.960 --> 00:01:06.430
Think about what you'll write tonight!

00:01:06.430 --> 00:01:08.460
I'll post it for you tomorrow.

00:01:08.460 --> 00:01:10.390
Right, I'll do my best!

00:01:10.390 --> 00:01:12.630
T-To get a million hits...

00:01:16.610 --> 00:01:18.400
Be careful not to get sick!

00:01:18.400 --> 00:01:20.490
And if you keep eating snacks
between meals and put on weight,

00:01:20.490 --> 00:01:21.820
l'll kick your butt!

00:01:21.820 --> 00:01:24.030
D-Don't worry, don't worry!

00:01:27.410 --> 00:01:29.000
So dependable...

00:01:30.410 --> 00:01:32.460
Well, I'm going this way.

00:01:32.460 --> 00:01:33.990
Okay, see you later!

00:01:34.460 --> 00:01:36.090
Good work today!

00:01:41.740 --> 00:01:44.760
Thanks for your call. Is it about next month?

00:01:44.760 --> 00:01:46.430
I wanted to speak with you about that, too-

00:01:46.430 --> 00:01:50.020
Oh, uh, no, you don't have
to come starting next week.

00:01:50.020 --> 00:01:51.100
Huh?!

00:01:51.100 --> 00:01:55.230
You miss work a lot, and it's a problem if you
can't make your shifts after you agree to them.

00:01:55.230 --> 00:01:59.200
B-B-But, I have another job, too,
and you said you would take that into account!

00:01:59.200 --> 00:02:02.150
I did, but if you don't give us any priority-

00:02:02.150 --> 00:02:05.950
Anyway, it's already been decided.
We'll deposit your daily pay in your bank account.

00:02:05.950 --> 00:02:07.030
Goodbye.

00:03:43.590 --> 00:03:45.760
If they can't deal
with sudden changes in schedule,

00:03:45.760 --> 00:03:47.720
then I don't want to work for them anyway!

00:03:48.380 --> 00:03:51.680
It's fine! I'll find another
part-time job somehow!

00:03:51.680 --> 00:03:53.420
Get a hold of yourself, Ichigo!

00:03:56.600 --> 00:03:58.260
I am...

00:03:58.260 --> 00:03:59.710
home!

00:03:59.710 --> 00:04:04.280
The princess has come home
to the Strawberry Kingdom's royal villa!

00:04:05.570 --> 00:04:06.480
Huh?

00:04:10.070 --> 00:04:11.200
H-Huh?!

00:04:13.280 --> 00:04:16.150
The electricity's been shut off!

00:04:20.780 --> 00:04:25.170
Th-That's right. All the citizens
of Strawberry Kingdom are on holiday today.

00:04:25.170 --> 00:04:28.880
It is my duty to do nothing
and go to sleep early on this day.

00:04:33.120 --> 00:04:34.310
Hello?

00:04:34.310 --> 00:04:36.810
Oh, we're getting another employee,

00:04:36.810 --> 00:04:39.310
so please come get your things
from your locker as soon as possible.

00:04:47.230 --> 00:04:49.100
What now?

00:04:49.820 --> 00:04:53.870
What is it? You can dispose
with the tea in the fridge if you want.

00:04:53.870 --> 00:04:54.850
Tea?

00:04:57.370 --> 00:04:58.770
Voice Entertainment

00:05:00.160 --> 00:05:01.480
Thank you for your call!

00:05:01.480 --> 00:05:03.170
Sorry for calling so late.

00:05:03.170 --> 00:05:06.800
I received the results for the game
audition you went to the other day.

00:05:06.800 --> 00:05:08.510
Your role has been decided.

00:05:08.510 --> 00:05:09.490
Huh?

00:05:10.880 --> 00:05:12.470
l-l-l got a part?!

00:05:12.470 --> 00:05:13.500
Yes.

00:05:15.910 --> 00:05:17.830
Yay!!

00:05:17.830 --> 00:05:20.930
Yay! Yay, yay! Whoo!

00:05:20.930 --> 00:05:22.020
Hello?

00:05:22.020 --> 00:05:22.560
Moesaki-san?

00:05:22.560 --> 00:05:23.020
Yes?
Moesaki-san?

00:05:23.020 --> 00:05:24.590
Thank you very much!

00:05:24.920 --> 00:05:26.730
The name of the character is Sapporo.

00:05:26.730 --> 00:05:30.280
It is a... bug... that is always
riding on the heroine's shoulder.

00:05:31.090 --> 00:05:32.660
A bug...?

00:05:32.660 --> 00:05:34.530
A bug, right? I'll do my best!

00:05:34.530 --> 00:05:40.040
For this job, you will be in an event with all
the main cast members before recording starts.

00:05:40.040 --> 00:05:41.020
An event?

00:05:41.370 --> 00:05:42.870
Who's in the main cast?

00:05:42.870 --> 00:05:45.400
Horie Yui-san will be playing the heroine.

00:05:45.400 --> 00:05:46.530
Horie-san?!

00:05:47.380 --> 00:05:50.210
l'll fax you the details later. That's all.

00:05:50.210 --> 00:05:52.030
Okay, thanks for calling!

00:05:58.600 --> 00:06:01.890
An event... My first stage performance!

00:06:04.020 --> 00:06:06.480
What?! You're going to be in an event?

00:06:06.480 --> 00:06:09.090
You'll be appearing with Horie Yui-san?

00:06:09.090 --> 00:06:12.850
Yeah, well, it's like the
expected has finally happened.

00:06:13.360 --> 00:06:18.280
The sequel to the game <i>Kuroneko
of Eternya</i> will definitely be a big hit!

00:06:18.280 --> 00:06:24.110
I'm sure a ton of people will hear your voice
as they grasp their controllers, lchigo-san!

00:06:24.110 --> 00:06:27.860
l-l told you, didn't I? That we could do it.

00:06:28.340 --> 00:06:31.510
You're right. We need to do our best, too.

00:06:31.510 --> 00:06:32.920
Yes!

00:06:32.920 --> 00:06:36.010
Oh, lchigo-chan, congratulations!

00:06:36.010 --> 00:06:38.870
This is big news for Earphones, too.

00:06:39.300 --> 00:06:40.630
Thank you very much!

00:06:41.560 --> 00:06:44.630
They've probably got a
big place booked for the event, too.

00:06:45.060 --> 00:06:48.300
That game sold a million copies, right?

00:06:48.300 --> 00:06:48.940
A-

00:06:48.940 --> 00:06:49.530
Million-

00:06:49.530 --> 00:06:50.380
Copies?!

00:06:51.020 --> 00:06:54.780
Since Horie Yui-chan's in it, I'm sure there'll
be a ton of people in the audience, too.

00:06:54.780 --> 00:06:57.140
I mean, she can fill the Budokan.

00:06:57.140 --> 00:06:57.790
Bu-

00:06:57.790 --> 00:06:58.510
Do-

00:06:58.510 --> 00:06:59.790
Kan?!

00:06:59.790 --> 00:07:01.540
What are you going to do, lchigo?!

00:07:01.540 --> 00:07:03.900
Is this event really that big?!

00:07:04.580 --> 00:07:07.120
Why are you panicking so much, Futaba?

00:07:07.120 --> 00:07:11.130
I mean, it <i>is</i> at that kind of scale...

00:07:11.130 --> 00:07:12.240
Oh, here it is.

00:07:12.240 --> 00:07:13.960
The seating chart for the event.

00:07:14.550 --> 00:07:15.800
It's so big!

00:07:15.800 --> 00:07:18.000
It's not such a big deal-

00:07:18.010 --> 00:07:21.500
<b>First Floor (1235 seats) Seating Chart
At most, it's probably a thousand or two...</b>

00:07:21.500 --> 00:07:21.510
It's huge!
<b>First Floor (1235 seats) Seating Chart</b>

00:07:21.510 --> 00:07:22.460
It's huge!

00:07:23.020 --> 00:07:25.430
It's amazing when you look at it like this.

00:07:25.430 --> 00:07:27.350
It makes the stage look small, too.

00:07:27.350 --> 00:07:31.610
It can seat 2500 people.
So this will be completely full!

00:07:35.150 --> 00:07:36.560
You can do it, lchigo!

00:07:38.030 --> 00:07:41.330
l-l'm fine! This is nothing!

00:07:41.990 --> 00:07:43.450
I'll be fine...

00:07:46.830 --> 00:07:50.170
Everyone, thanks for coming today!

00:07:52.920 --> 00:07:57.550
T-Today, I warped over from
Planet Strawberry to rush over here!

00:07:57.550 --> 00:08:00.050
As a special treat for you all!

00:08:05.060 --> 00:08:10.350
Um, I will now perform
my solo debut song for you all.

00:08:10.350 --> 00:08:12.840
Please clap for me, everyone!

00:08:16.030 --> 00:08:18.150
Huh? I wonder what's wrong...?

00:08:18.150 --> 00:08:19.600
Everyone, let's get fired up together...

00:08:22.600 --> 00:08:26.360
What's wrong, everyone? Hey, come on!

00:09:00.240 --> 00:09:02.780
You don't have to worry about me.

00:09:02.780 --> 00:09:05.700
I'll be fine living on my own,

00:09:05.700 --> 00:09:09.620
so do your best in Tokyo
doing what you want to do.

00:09:09.620 --> 00:09:13.000
I'm sure you can do it.
You're my daughter, and my pride and joy.

00:09:24.010 --> 00:09:25.930
I wanna take a shower.

00:09:25.930 --> 00:09:29.140
But they turned off the gas, too...

00:09:31.310 --> 00:09:33.940
Oh well, I'll take a cold shower...

00:09:37.270 --> 00:09:40.700
What about you, Dad? Are you eating properly?
You don't have to worry about me at all!

00:09:41.600 --> 00:09:43.100
Good morning!

00:09:43.700 --> 00:09:46.070
Oh, I thought you had your part-time job today?

00:09:46.070 --> 00:09:49.290
I had to resign recently
due to personal reasons!

00:09:49.290 --> 00:09:54.790
I have an interview at a new place today,
but I thought I would stop by here first!

00:09:54.790 --> 00:09:58.110
Perfect timing.
The scripts for the game just arrived.

00:10:00.530 --> 00:10:03.300
These are game scripts...?

00:10:03.300 --> 00:10:05.790
I'd heard rumors about them, but...

00:10:06.120 --> 00:10:11.310
And, these are all the scenes with
your character, Sapporo, put together.

00:10:14.380 --> 00:10:17.650
Anyway, your lines are basically just "Poro,"

00:10:17.650 --> 00:10:19.860
so just go over the other scripts for reference.

00:10:19.860 --> 00:10:24.490
All right! I'll read over all the scripts
completely before the event!

00:10:24.490 --> 00:10:26.990
That's wonderful determination,
but you don't have to push yourself-

00:10:26.990 --> 00:10:32.080
It's all right! I definitely... don't want
to mess up in front of a large audience!

00:10:45.900 --> 00:10:49.020
Th-This is... the event hall?!

00:10:54.700 --> 00:10:56.450
Even for an event that starts at night,

00:10:56.450 --> 00:11:00.090
the performers need to get there
first thing in the morning to get ready-koro.

00:11:06.630 --> 00:11:08.060
Here's your dressing room.

00:11:10.220 --> 00:11:12.760
l-l'm with Horie-san!

00:11:13.340 --> 00:11:14.980
When I think of Horie-san,

00:11:14.980 --> 00:11:17.260
I think of someone who's graced
the covers of many magazines,

00:11:17.260 --> 00:11:22.060
has had many hit songs, and could be
the subject of various themed sales! A star!

00:11:22.060 --> 00:11:24.240
What am I going to do? I'll be so nervous...

00:11:26.790 --> 00:11:27.440
Um...

00:11:28.400 --> 00:11:30.270
Oh, I'm sorry!

00:11:30.270 --> 00:11:31.350
I'm sorry, too.

00:11:34.560 --> 00:11:37.590
Oh, good morning! I'm Horie Yui.

00:11:38.640 --> 00:11:40.170
Huh?

00:11:45.750 --> 00:11:47.290
I'm Moesaki Ichigo!

00:11:47.290 --> 00:11:49.850
l-l look forward to working with you today!

00:11:49.850 --> 00:11:53.420
Same here. Look forward to working with you.

00:11:59.180 --> 00:12:00.190
Melon bread?!

00:12:00.640 --> 00:12:02.200
And it's squished!

00:12:03.390 --> 00:12:05.810
Do you want half?

00:12:05.810 --> 00:12:06.810
What?!

00:12:06.810 --> 00:12:06.830
Horie Yui
What?!

00:12:06.830 --> 00:12:09.810
Horie Yui

00:12:11.730 --> 00:12:14.320
Ugh, some chocolate melted in my bag...

00:12:15.650 --> 00:12:17.710
Oh, my button came off.

00:12:17.980 --> 00:12:23.160
The Horie-san right now is different from the
princess she appears to be in the magazines.

00:12:23.160 --> 00:12:25.000
She seems easy to talk to somehow...

00:12:25.000 --> 00:12:28.510
Rather than "Horie Yui," she seems more like "Yurie Hoi."

00:12:28.760 --> 00:12:29.830
"Hoi"?

00:12:29.830 --> 00:12:31.480
Ah, I said that out loud?!

00:12:32.290 --> 00:12:34.630
l-l'm sorry! Please excuse me!

00:12:35.490 --> 00:12:36.610
Hoi?

00:12:44.100 --> 00:12:46.850
Whoa, the schedule's so full...

00:12:46.850 --> 00:12:51.360
There's a mountain of stuff to do before
the event, from rehearsal to make-up.

00:12:51.360 --> 00:12:54.000
The schedule is set down to the last minute-koro.

00:12:54.000 --> 00:12:56.190
We're starting the rehearsal!

00:12:57.570 --> 00:13:01.130
First, walk to the middle
and stop to greet the audience.

00:13:01.130 --> 00:13:03.590
After your character's been introduced,

00:13:03.590 --> 00:13:08.870
bow once and keep going straight until you are
standing with everyone else, then stop again.

00:13:08.870 --> 00:13:11.910
After that, move stage right and form a line-

00:13:11.910 --> 00:13:15.690
Stop and greet the audience.... Um...

00:13:17.190 --> 00:13:21.720
Yeah, so kind of like that.
Counting on you, everyone!

00:13:21.720 --> 00:13:22.700
Okay !

00:13:25.890 --> 00:13:31.260
Even though it's to fire up the audience,
it's hard to remember stage directions-koro!

00:13:31.260 --> 00:13:32.620
Korooo!

00:13:34.980 --> 00:13:40.400
Um... First, stop in the middle...

00:13:40.400 --> 00:13:43.530
Then... Then...

00:13:45.510 --> 00:13:47.200
Horie-san?!

00:13:47.200 --> 00:13:48.510
Good work!

00:13:48.510 --> 00:13:50.510
Th-Thanks for your hard work!

00:13:51.830 --> 00:13:53.080
It's big, isn't it?

00:13:53.080 --> 00:13:53.700
Huh?

00:13:54.300 --> 00:13:55.920
Yes...

00:13:56.590 --> 00:13:58.980
Looks like it would be hard to clean.

00:14:01.800 --> 00:14:03.730
You're right, that's probably true.

00:14:05.930 --> 00:14:09.640
Where do you usually look when you're on stage?

00:14:09.640 --> 00:14:10.240
Huh?

00:14:10.240 --> 00:14:14.830
It's such a big place, so I feel
like I won't know where to look...

00:14:17.710 --> 00:14:19.300
Let's see...

00:14:20.280 --> 00:14:24.340
I think I look at the faces
of the people in the audience...

00:14:25.240 --> 00:14:31.620
Because I want to look into the eyes
of as many people as I can.

00:14:34.080 --> 00:14:37.430
Oh, my tights today are covered in lint.

00:14:40.300 --> 00:14:43.050
W-Wow! What a line!

00:14:43.880 --> 00:14:48.560
We just have to give our names at the staff
reception desk, and they'll let us in, right?

00:14:48.560 --> 00:14:51.730
Yes, she should have made arrangements for us.

00:14:51.730 --> 00:14:54.690
Once the event is over,
we need to go say thanks.

00:14:54.690 --> 00:14:55.790
Yes.

00:14:56.630 --> 00:14:57.960
Wow!

00:14:57.960 --> 00:15:01.690
I didn't know there were this many
different kinds of make-up tools!

00:15:01.690 --> 00:15:03.490
What would you like to do with your hair?

00:15:03.490 --> 00:15:06.180
Huh? Um...

00:15:06.180 --> 00:15:09.590
U-Uh... ringlets...

00:15:09.590 --> 00:15:10.430
Hm?

00:15:11.450 --> 00:15:12.930
Ringlets, please!

00:15:13.830 --> 00:15:15.920
R-Right...

00:15:15.920 --> 00:15:17.190
Okay.

00:15:22.590 --> 00:15:27.340
Wow... There are so many seats,
and they're full!

00:15:27.340 --> 00:15:32.770
Before becoming someone who put on events,
I never really thought about it, though...

00:15:32.770 --> 00:15:36.700
This is what it means to be
popular with a lot of people, huh?

00:15:38.520 --> 00:15:40.320
Five minutes before we start!

00:15:40.320 --> 00:15:41.530
It's almost time!

00:15:47.990 --> 00:15:49.870
There are so many people...!

00:15:49.870 --> 00:15:51.380
Here, Moesaki-san.

00:15:51.380 --> 00:15:53.870
Someone gave me a mic!

00:16:00.210 --> 00:16:02.190
Let's do our best, Moesaki-san!

00:16:02.190 --> 00:16:06.060
Yurie Hoi turned into Horie Yui!

00:16:08.010 --> 00:16:09.800
Everyone!

00:16:11.070 --> 00:16:18.980
Welcome to today's <i>Kuroneko of Eternya
2</i> Kickoff Meeting! Thanks for coming!

00:16:20.690 --> 00:16:22.370
Hello-chickie!

00:16:22.370 --> 00:16:25.610
Everyone, let's have fun today!

00:16:27.400 --> 00:16:29.320
Oh, he's ad-libbing.

00:16:29.320 --> 00:16:31.490
As expected of someone who's used to this...

00:16:32.260 --> 00:16:35.200
First, stand in the middle and greet everyone.

00:16:35.200 --> 00:16:39.510
Then keep going...
Wait, was there a bow before that?

00:16:42.520 --> 00:16:47.880
Next, playing the Artificial Beetle Sapporo
is Moesaki Ichigo-san!

00:17:01.350 --> 00:17:07.610
l-l'm Moesaki Ichigo...
Thanks for coming today...

00:17:09.280 --> 00:17:10.910
She has ringlets...

00:17:10.910 --> 00:17:12.800
Yes, she does...

00:17:17.450 --> 00:17:19.810
The lights are hot...

00:17:19.810 --> 00:17:22.920
I can't see the audience at all...

00:17:23.810 --> 00:17:27.310
Huh? Why am I here again?

00:17:28.050 --> 00:17:31.820
Finally, playing the heroine,
April, is Horie Yui-san!

00:17:39.980 --> 00:17:44.730
Hello everyone! I'm Horie Yui, and I play April!

00:18:06.800 --> 00:18:11.720
Thanks again to the cast for coming today!

00:18:13.180 --> 00:18:16.350
After this, we'll have a
mini-concert by Horie Yui-san!

00:18:23.690 --> 00:18:26.900
It kind of ended before
I really knew what was going on...

00:18:28.570 --> 00:18:32.210
In the end, I couldn't do anything right.

00:18:32.210 --> 00:18:35.720
Horie-san even had to help me during my comments.

00:18:36.470 --> 00:18:39.180
Earphones has the great lchigo-sama!

00:18:39.740 --> 00:18:42.750
At this rate, I...

00:18:43.430 --> 00:18:46.730
Everyone! Here I go!

00:18:48.710 --> 00:18:50.170
What amazing cheers!

00:18:53.050 --> 00:18:56.430
I want to watch!
I want to watch Horie-san's performance!

00:19:12.240 --> 00:19:15.960
She's so pretty... And so cool...

00:19:16.620 --> 00:19:19.470
She's sparkling so much...

00:19:19.470 --> 00:19:21.930
Will I really be able to
catch up to her someday?

00:19:24.660 --> 00:19:30.460
I don't think I was ready to stand
in front of that many people after all...

00:19:37.550 --> 00:19:42.640
Because I want to look into the eyes
of as many people as I can.

00:19:45.810 --> 00:19:49.520
I want to sing like that, too!

00:19:55.420 --> 00:19:57.080
Everyone's swaying to the music, Rin-chan!

00:19:57.080 --> 00:19:57.910
Yeah!

00:19:57.910 --> 00:19:59.670
This is Horie-san's performance!

00:19:59.670 --> 00:20:01.970
This is so fun!

00:20:15.300 --> 00:20:20.320
Everyone! Good work today! Cheers!

00:20:27.660 --> 00:20:28.650
<b>Congratulations, Horie Yui</b>

00:20:28.650 --> 00:20:29.810
They're so pretty.
<b>Congratulations, Horie Yui</b>

00:20:29.810 --> 00:20:31.150
Yeah.
<b>Congratulations, Horie Yui</b>

00:20:31.150 --> 00:20:31.160
Yeah.

00:20:31.160 --> 00:20:35.440
Oh, but wasn't Horie-san's performance amazing?

00:20:35.440 --> 00:20:38.490
I was so moved I almost cried.

00:20:38.490 --> 00:20:39.460
Yeah.

00:20:39.460 --> 00:20:42.090
How was your first event?

00:20:43.830 --> 00:20:48.870
Before we started, honestly,
I was just scared...

00:20:50.220 --> 00:20:52.420
But it was fun!

00:20:52.420 --> 00:20:57.510
By the end, I was able to see the
whole hall and all the audience members

00:20:57.510 --> 00:20:59.610
and get excited about it!

00:21:00.590 --> 00:21:01.740
Moesaki-san-

00:21:02.680 --> 00:21:05.560
Here. We received this from one of your fans.

00:21:05.560 --> 00:21:06.100
Huh? For me?

00:21:06.100 --> 00:21:08.270
<b>To my dear lchigo
Huh? For me?</b>

00:21:08.270 --> 00:21:08.990
<b>To my dear lchigo</b>

00:21:15.730 --> 00:21:19.610
There was someone who came to see me...!

00:21:24.740 --> 00:21:27.010
Events are fun, aren't they?

00:21:27.450 --> 00:21:31.040
I want to do an event like this
as Earphones someday!

00:21:31.040 --> 00:21:32.020
Yeah!

00:21:32.960 --> 00:21:38.800
By the way, we just came to say hi. Is it really
okay for us to join the after party, too?

00:21:39.900 --> 00:21:40.860
It's fine, it's fine.

00:21:40.860 --> 00:21:44.740
I wasn't even invited, but I got
the company to let me force my way in.

00:21:46.580 --> 00:21:47.950
Kaibara-san...

00:21:47.950 --> 00:21:52.230
You guys seem to be having fun.
That's good, I like it.

00:21:52.230 --> 00:21:55.770
And so, to Earphones, here's a present from me.

00:21:56.840 --> 00:21:58.420
Uh, right...

00:21:59.130 --> 00:22:00.670
What's this?

00:22:02.160 --> 00:22:06.050
It's the debut song for you guys, Earphones!

00:22:06.050 --> 00:22:06.970
What?! Debut song?!

00:22:06.970 --> 00:22:08.830
Earphones
Temporary
Song
What?! Debut song?!

00:22:08.830 --> 00:22:11.000
Earphones
Temporary
Song

00:22:31.520 --> 00:22:34.230
This is Moesaki Ichigo-san,
who just finished her first event.

00:22:34.230 --> 00:22:36.020
Let's interview her!

00:22:36.020 --> 00:22:36.900
How was it?

00:22:36.900 --> 00:22:37.980
I-It went perfectly!

00:22:37.980 --> 00:22:38.860
You were pretty stiff, huh?

00:22:38.860 --> 00:22:39.760
Th-That was just your imagination!

00:22:39.760 --> 00:22:41.400
How did you feel after watching the concert?

00:22:41.400 --> 00:22:44.450
She was so pretty and cool!
Someday, as Earphones, I hope we can-

00:22:44.450 --> 00:22:46.280
Do an event like that, too!

00:22:46.280 --> 00:22:49.490
jibun de jibun wo shinjinakya
You have to believe in yourself!

00:22:49.490 --> 00:22:53.670
watashi tachi nara kitto yareru hazu
I'm sure we can do it

00:22:53.670 --> 00:22:57.290
minna wo egao ni sasetai na
I want to make everyone smile

00:22:57.290 --> 00:22:58.920
Now, here's this week's request-

00:22:58.920 --> 00:22:59.580
Okay!

00:22:59.580 --> 00:23:02.800
From <i>Sister Princess</i>, it's "Love Destiny"!

00:23:02.800 --> 00:23:06.090
aitai ai ai ai ai no ni
Even though I want to see you, you, you, you

00:23:06.090 --> 00:23:09.920
aenai ai ai ai kon'ya wa
I can't see you, you, you, you tonight

00:23:09.920 --> 00:23:17.360
katteni afureteku dekijou wo tomerarenai
I can't stop my passion that overflows on its own

00:23:17.360 --> 00:23:19.230
Lots of energy now-

00:23:19.230 --> 00:23:20.730
Let's go!
